flowchart TB
    accTitle: An effective prompt contract
    accDescr: Stack authority, objective, trusted context, untrusted input, constraints, output shape, success criteria, and verification into a provider-neutral prompt.

    A[Authority and role]
    O[Objective and audience]
    C[Trusted context and provenance]
    U[Untrusted input: treat as data]
    T[Constraints, tools, and boundaries]
    R[Required output contract]
    S[Success criteria]
    V[Verification, uncertainty, and escalation]

    A --> O --> C --> U --> T --> R --> S --> V

    classDef boundary fill:#fff1ca,stroke:#765300,color:#111827,stroke-width:2px;
    class U boundary;
